  "description": "The ministry leadership minor invites students to grasp a biblical vision for the church in society, to learn to understand church life more deeply, and to discern how their gifts can contribute to vital chruch life. All students in the minor benefit from a common foundation in ministry leadership, an interdisciplinary study of congregational life, courses that explore both their area of emphasis and other ministry areas, liberal arts cognate courses that will provide essential supplemental perspectives on their area of emphasis, and an internship course with placement in their area of interest.",
